    "prompt": {
      "description": "A destitute volunteer with nothing that was ever issued to them. An oversized head wrapped in a torn cloth rag knotted off to one side, no helmet and no brim, an open face with two sunken eyes. A plain unbelted shirt, thin sloping shoulders, bare wrapped legs and rag-bound feet. Held across the body at a steep angle, a single over-long wooden haft far taller than the figure, tipped with one small iron tine at the top and a bare butt end below the hip. Nothing on this person is armour.",
      "must_include": [
        "torn cloth rag wrapping the head, knotted off to one side - no helmet, no skullcap, no brim",
        "an over-long wooden haft on a steep diagonal, longer than the torso, its far end clear of the body outline at both ends",
        "one small iron tine at the top of the haft, the only worked metal on the figure",
        "a plain unbelted shirt and bare wrapped legs, no armour of any kind",
        "narrow sloping shoulders, uneven and soft",
        "two dark sunken eye recesses in an open face"
      ],
      "must_avoid": [
        "helmet, skullcap, brim, visor, crest or plume",
        "any armour plate, pauldron, mail or greaves",
        "spear, polearm or any weapon held vertically",
        "shield of any shape",
        "banner, flag, pennant or standard",
        "horn, trumpet or any curved object above the head",
